text = "[center]Created by:[/center]
[center][outline_color=#c90046][fancy_name clr1=fcf4c7 clr2=fcbfdc][font_size=28][outline_size=3][url=lala]Echo_Laliaa[/url][/outline_size][/font_size][/fancy_name][/outline_color][/center]
[center][hr color=#605947][/center]

Voice lines provided by:
[ul][outline_color=#1c3870][fancy_name clr1=f1eaf9 clr2=9fb4dd][font_size=22][outline_size=4] Hanner[/outline_size][/font_size][/fancy_name][/outline_color]
[outline_color=#361d75][fancy_name clr1=#f3a0f7 clr2=#8fe9f7][font_size=22][outline_size=4] Zuzzok[/outline_size][/font_size][/fancy_name][/outline_color][/ul]

Made in [outline_color=#478cbf][fancy_name clr1=#ffff clr2=#90bcdd][outline_size=2]Godot[/outline_size][/fancy_name][/outline_color].
Public domain sounds sourced from [outline_color=#892e36][fancy_name clr1=#ffff clr2=#e5ccce][outline_size=2]freesound.org[/outline_size][/fancy_name][/outline_color].
Additional thanks to [outline_color=#1c3870][fancy_name clr1=f1eaf9 clr2=9fb4dd][outline_size=2]Hanner Gayness[/outline_size][/fancy_name][/outline_color] for capturing the only verified photos of Hank Alpeca.
And thank you to [outline_color=#44142e][fancy_name clr1=#fcd9e4 clr2=#f9a9dc][outline_size=2]everyone in the community[/outline_size][/fancy_name][/outline_color] for encouraging me to make silly art."
